								<div id="contentForThisGame_ctn">
				</div>
									<div data-panel="{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;PanelGroup&quot;}" id="aboutThisGame" class="game_page_autocollapse" style="max-height: 850px;">
						<div id="game_area_description" class="game_area_description">
							<h2>About This Game</h2>
							<h2 class="bb_tag" >The supreme powerhouse of the Hao realm.</h2><span class="bb_img_ctn"><img class="bb_img" src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5001630/extras/2de386c38d8700d3764aa38312e24719.avif?t=1793359196" width=1280 height=180 /></span><h2 class="bb_tag" >Still young. Still a demon king in his prime.</h2><span class="bb_img_ctn"><img class="bb_img" src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5001630/extras/8ab8fe42f624bb38a11a8ab1c0c06370.avif?t=1793359196" width=1280 height=180 /></span><h2 class="bb_tag" >Still the man who never feels pressure</h2><span class="bb_img_ctn"><img class="bb_img" src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5001630/extras/e1f15b56794a584804cdde8c3e2f9f3b.avif?t=1793359196" width=1280 height=180 /></span><h2 class="bb_tag" >Still wild enough to shake Asia</h2><span class="bb_img_ctn"><img class="bb_img" src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5001630/extras/af5051206365df351068c26acf4762af.avif?t=1793359196" width=1280 height=180 /></span><h2 class="bb_tag" >Still a pain the world cannot endure</h2><span class="bb_img_ctn"><img class="bb_img" src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5001630/extras/b663244b899eb7a5548d70f0504dcfed.avif?t=1793359196" width=1280 height=180 /></span><h2 class="bb_tag" >Still here to knock you back to reality</h2><span class="bb_img_ctn"><img class="bb_img" src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5001630/extras/1ab6fe961aea3c6f246b251bee7ad38c.avif?t=1793359196" width=1280 height=180 /></span><h2 class="bb_tag" >A brief explanation: what Jiahao actually does</h2><ul class="bb_ul"><li>Jiahao moves into your desktop uninvited—and with no intention of toning himself down.</li><li>Click, rapid-click, hold, drag, or right-click Jiahao directly on your desktop.</li><li>Pressure has never belonged to Jiahao. A problem may defeat him, but it can never diminish his swagger.</li><li>Use 15 desktop tools, including to-do lists, sticky notes, focus timers, schedules, stock tools, and ambient sounds.</li><li>Earn HaoYi, climb eight HaoGe ranks, top the HaoYi leaderboard, and become Ultra Instinct Hao.</li></ul><h2 class="bb_tag" >One last thing:</h2><span class="bb_img_ctn"><img class="bb_img" src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5001630/extras/3378c3030e041c33505b24030d3d4f8f.avif?t=1793359196" width=1280 height=180 /></span><h2 class="bb_tag" >I am the most Hao of them all.</h2>						</div>
					</div>
					<div class="game_page_autocollapse">
		<div id="game_area_content_descriptors" class="game_area_description">
			<h2>AI Generated Content Disclosure</h2>
			<p>The developers describe how their game uses AI Generated Content like this:</p>
			<p><i>
					Some in-game character art, animation frames, UI and item icons, character voice lines, and store/promotional artwork were created or refined with generative AI tools. The development team selected, edited, reviewed, and curated the final AI-assisted assets. All AI content is pre-generated; no generative AI runs during gameplay.				</i>
			</p>
					</div>
	</div>
	
				
				
